        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Echoes of the Wind” is a psychological thriller where camping in the woods turns unsettling. Unravel mysteries, face hidden fears, and survive what lurks beyond the trees in chilling silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person camping simulation set in the vast Canadian wilderness. The game blends camping simulation with atmospheric storytelling, immersing players in the beauty of Canada’s wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as night falls, unease creeps in. Distant branches snap. Shadows shift between the trees. Something is out there—lurking, watching. The line between nature’s ordinary dangers and something far darker begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic Canadian camping simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildlife Encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative branches balancing peaceful exploration and psychological horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Echoes of the Wind” is a psychological thriller where camping in the woods turns unsettling. Unravel mysteries, face hidden fears, and survive what lurks beyond the trees in chilling silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person camping simulation set in the vast Canadian wilderness. The game blends camping simulation with atmospheric storytelling, immersing players in the beauty of Canada’s wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as night falls, unease creeps in. Distant branches snap. Shadows shift between the trees. Something is out there—lurking, watching. The line between nature’s ordinary dangers and something far darker begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic Canadian camping simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildlife Encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative branches balancing peaceful exploration and psychological horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
